    <statement><p>Evaluate the following expressions for <m>x = 2</m>,
<m>y = -4</m>, and <m>z = -5</m> without using
a calculator.  Simplify your answers as much
as possible, and enter your answers as fractions.</p>
<tabular>
<row>
<cell><m>y^x</m></cell>
<cell><m>=</m></cell>
<cell><fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></cell>
</row>
<row>
<cell><m>\displaystyle \left( \frac{y}{z} \right)^x</m></cell>
<cell><m>=</m></cell>
<cell><fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/></cell>
</row>
<row>
<cell><m>x^{-z}</m></cell>
<cell><m>=</m></cell>
<cell><fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0003"/></cell>
</row>
</tabular>
</statement>
